

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:23
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_4ddc3532:

    # "Outside, I could hear birds chirping as they perched on the rooftops."
    "Fuera, oía el piar de los pájaros posados en los tejados."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:45
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_e6a89b31:

    # "As my eyes peeled open and the bright light from the stained-glass windows blazed into the infirmary, I rose from my slumber, still groggy, the light piercing my pounding head."
    "Cuando abrí los ojos y la brillante luz de las vidrieras iluminó la enfermería, me levanté de mi letargo, aún aturdido, con la luz penetrando en mi cabeza palpitante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:46
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_3969545e:

    # "Slowly, my blurred vision started to restore itself."
    "Poco a poco, mi visión borrosa empezó a restablecerse."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:47
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_077e7e7a:

    # "I groaned painfully, my entire body aching."
    "Gemí dolorosamente, me dolía todo el cuerpo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:48
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_c2fbea1b:

    # "As I reached up to rub my temple, I noticed a peculiar thickness to my arm, which now appeared to be bulging with muscles and veins."
    "Cuando levanté la mano para frotarme la sien, noté un grosor peculiar en mi brazo, que ahora parecía abultado de músculos y venas."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:51
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_3c3981f9:

    # MC "...What?"
    MC "...¿Qué?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:52
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_b5e4fd59:

    # "Rising out of bed, I hauled myself over to the mirror, the reflection that stared back at me was not the same man as last night."
    "Me levanté de la cama y me acerqué al espejo. El reflejo que me devolvió la mirada no era el mismo de la noche anterior."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:53
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_1da4f5a4:

    # "I had grown a few inches in height and across every inch of my body was a layer of thick, refined muscle, defiant beneath my hospital gown."
    "Había crecido unos centímetros de estatura y en cada centímetro de mi cuerpo había una capa de músculos gruesos y refinados, desafiantes bajo mi bata de hospital."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:54
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_127a0a8a:

    # "My cheekbones and jaw were far more defined than they had been, my hair was thicker and longer, as I ran my tongue along my teeth, even they felt straighter and stronger."
    "Mis pómulos y mi mandíbula estaban mucho más definidos que antes, mi pelo era más grueso y largo, al pasar la lengua por mis dientes, incluso los sentí más rectos y fuertes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:57
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_fbfe0116:

    # MC @ surprised "...!"
    MC @ surprised "¡...!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:58
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_39fa89fe:

    # MC @ surprised "What... What’s happened to me?"
    MC @ surprised "¿Qué... ¿Qué me ha pasado?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:59
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_ce2a6219:

    # MC @ surprised "That... {i}That horrible dream last night{/i}... It can’t have..."
    MC @ surprised "Ese... {i}Ese horrible sueño de anoche{/i}... No puede ser..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:60
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_850573be:

    # "I tried to call out to the thing that I dreaded to find lurking deep inside of me, desperate to know if I’d fabricated the events of last night... or not, but no answer came."
    "Intenté llamar a lo que temía encontrarme acechando en lo más profundo de mí, desesperado por saber si me había inventado los sucesos de anoche... o no, pero no obtuve respuesta."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:61
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_39880ee1:

    # MC @ sad "It— I don’t remember..."
    MC @ sad "Es— No recuerdo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:62
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_9b89e3b2:

    # "Looking down at the dent in the fabric tangled round my waist, I couldn’t resist the curiosity and peered under it to see if ‘everything’ had grown and, indeed, I found myself smiling slyly with the realisation that it had."
    "Al ver la abolladura en la tela que me rodeaba la cintura, no pude resistir la curiosidad y miré por debajo para ver si ‘todo’ había crecido y, efectivamente, sonreí pícaramente al darme cuenta de que así era."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:63
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_b5739f8e:

    # "Before I could get too excited about that particular aspect, I heard Markus’ voice call my name."
    "Antes de que pudiera entusiasmarme demasiado con ese aspecto en particular, oí la voz de Markus llamándome por mi nombre."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:64
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_155a2d34:

    # "Spinning around with a sense of dread, it became immediately apparent that Markus, too, had changed."
    "Al darse la vuelta con una sensación de temor, se hizo evidente de inmediato que Markus también había cambiado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:65
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_d5a2c299:

    # "Like mine, his face was more refined, more handsome, his hair now flowed in long golden curls, bouncing off his shoulders."
    "Al igual que el mío, su rostro era más refinado, más apuesto, su pelo ahora fluía en largos rizos dorados, rebotando sobre sus hombros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:66
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_7788ba97:

    # "His body too had become stronger, his muscles pressed against the material of his clothes which now struggled to contain them."
    "Su cuerpo también se había fortalecido, sus músculos se apretaban contra el material de su ropa, que ahora luchaba por contenerlos."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:68
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_ad168160:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Nice to see you’re up."
    MARKUS @ smile "Me alegro de verte levantado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:74
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_42f215af:

    # MARKUS "I’m not sure, I woke up about half an hour ago and apparently, I look like this now."
    MARKUS "No estoy seguro, me he despertado hace media hora y, al parecer, ahora tengo este aspecto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:75
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_be81725f:

    # MARKUS "I tried to wake you, but you were completely out of it."
    MARKUS "Intenté despertarte, pero estabas completamente inconsciente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:79
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_19332d3a:

    # MARKUS "Yes... As do you."
    MARKUS "Sí... Como tú."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:80
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_ffef01d1:

    # MC @ talk "We need to talk about— "
    MC @ talk "Tenemos que hablar de— "

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:81
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_23f53501:

    # "Markus motioned frantically for me to shut up, nodding towards the door where guards were waiting outside."
    "Markus me hizo un gesto frenético para que me callara, señalando con la cabeza la puerta donde esperaban los guardias."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:82
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_cf8d441b:

    # MARKUS "Yes... I think we’ll both need a drink later."
    MARKUS "Sí... Creo que ambos necesitaremos un trago más tarde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:83
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_8ce9ba5b:

    # MC @ talk "... Yeah."
    MC @ talk "... Sí."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:87
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_f0675fae:

    # MARKUS "I don’t know... A nun came here a while back to give me some water, she said a guard would be by shortly to speak to us."
    MARKUS "No lo sé... Una monja vino aquí hace un rato a darme agua, dijo que un guardia vendría pronto a hablar con nosotros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:94
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_8e6851cb:

    # "As I finished speaking, the door unlocked and a high-ranking officer stepped inside with a few crumpled papers in his hand."
    "Cuando terminé de hablar, la puerta se abrió y un oficial de alto rango entró con unos papeles arrugados en la mano."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:96
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_f8f12c4f:

    # OFFICER @ talk "Good morning..."
    OFFICER @ talk "Buenos días..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:97
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_3fb80702:

    # "We both stared nonplussed at the figure before us."
    "Ambos miramos perplejos a la figura que teníamos delante."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:98
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_e7ad1e03:

    # MC @ talk "... Morning."
    MC @ talk "... Buenos días."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:99
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_280e3e83:

    # OFFICER "I am Officer Lukkan."
    OFFICER "Soy el oficial Lukkan."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:76
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_8a2d7107:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "... You two must be Markus Lucidican and [player_name!t]..."
    LUKKAN @ talk "... Vosotros dos debéis ser Markus Lucidican y [player_name!t]..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:102
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_2d9427e4:

    # "The officer fumbled, checking the paperwork for a moment before looking up."
    "El oficial tanteó, comprobando el papeleo por un momento antes de levantar la vista."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:103
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_7d82919e:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Eh, fuck it, I got the right pair, right?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "Eh, a la mierda, tengo el par correcto, ¿verdad?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:104
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_fad7e839:

    # MARKUS "Yes, that’s us."
    MARKUS "Sí, somos nosotros."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:105
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_93c6bd6d:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Right, I have come here today in representation of Emperor Alcott and hereby bestow upon you both a full pardon from active military service."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Bien, he venido aquí hoy en representación del emperador Alcott y por la presente os concedo a ambos el indulto total del servicio militar activo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:106
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_02e10820:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Here are your membership certificates for the Adventurers Guild and so on and so forth."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Aquí tenéis vuestros certificados de afiliación al gremio de aventureros, etcétera."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:107
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_eef93291:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "You’ve both already been approved, so it’s just a case of having you show up and introduce yourself..."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Los dos ya habéis sido aprobados, así que solo falta que aparezcáis y os presentéis..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:109
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_2c02590a:

    # MC @ talk "The Emperor said we have some type of ‘morale raising’ duty to fulfil?"
    MC @ talk "¿El emperador dijo que teníamos que cumplir algún tipo de deber para ‘levantar la moral’?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:110
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_ff88618e:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Yep, that’s right... We aim to hold at least one ‘Morale Rally’ a week, it’s good for the people to still feel we can win this war."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Sip, así es... Nos proponemos celebrar al menos una ‘Subida de moral’ a la semana, es bueno que la gente siga sintiendo que podemos ganar esta guerra."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:111
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_ac86c5d0:

    # MC @ talk "Because we can... right?"
    MC @ talk "Porque podemos... ¿verdad?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:112
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_bb15f4da:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "... Uhhh... Yeah, sure, absolutely."
    LUKKAN @ talk "... Uhhh ... Sí, claro, por supuesto."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:113
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_e1c4296b:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Under the Emperor’s orders you’ll be expected to attend at least one a month."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Bajo las órdenes del emperador se espera que asistas al menos a una al mes."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:114
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_Start_MarkusFirstTalk_cfc7fac1:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Do you understand?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "¿Lo habéis entendido?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:119
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_bf343de8:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "They can be a relatively small or much larger affair depending on the individual who’s speaking."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Pueden ser un asunto relativamente pequeño o mucho más grande, dependiendo de la persona que hable."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:120
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_fe7a54ba:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "You could be asked to make a small speech at some tavern or on a podium in the street, talking about your heroic victories in battle or whatever it was you did to earn such favour with the Emperor."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Podrían pediros que pronunciarais un pequeño discurso en alguna taberna o en un podio en la calle, hablando de vuestras heroicas victorias en batalla o de lo que fuera que hicisteis para ganaros tal favor del emperador."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:121
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_76489ce9:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Keep it optimistic, boys... No breaking down talking about how you saw your best friend sliced in half and we’ll get along just fine."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Mantened el optimismo, chicos... Nada de derrumbarse hablando de cómo viste a tu mejor amigo rebanado por la mitad y nos llevaremos bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:122
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_d6c42d8b:

    # MC @ talk "... That’s it?"
    MC @ talk "... ¿Eso es todo?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:123
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_93b90493:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Were you hoping for screaming crowds of adoring fans?"
    LUKKAN @ talk "¿Esperabas multitudes de fans que te adoraran?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:124
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_03d957fd:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "You kids are small time... In fact, from your notes I’m not even sure why the Emperor’s awarded you so many privileges to begin with."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Vosotros sois de poca monta... De hecho, por vuestras notas ni siquiera estoy seguro de por qué el emperador os ha concedido tantos privilegios para empezar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:125
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_8418a966:

    # MC @ talk "..."
    MC @ talk "..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:126
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_0c9a3ded:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "... But I suppose if you build on your reputation, perhaps we could make it a grander affair, so to speak."
    LUKKAN @ talk "... Pero supongo que si vosotros mejoráis vuestra reputación, tal vez podríamos hacer un asunto más grande, por así decirlo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:130
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_db4b4604:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "If you ‘forget’, me and a few other officers will be dragging your sorry asses out of whatever dive you’re in and throwing you onto the bloody stage, and believe you me, we will not be gentle."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Si vosotros ‘olvidáis’, yo y algunos otros oficiales sacaremos vuestros lamentables culos de cualquier antro en el que estéis y os arrojaremos al maldito escenario, y creedme, no seremos amables."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:131
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_5ed000f0:

    # MC @ talk "What if we’re away on a quest?"
    MC @ talk "¿Y si estamos fuera en una misión?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:132
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_1a6a51ad:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "As long as your service to the Emperor is fulfilled, {i}one way or another{/i}, I really do not care."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Mientras vuestro servicio al emperador se cumpla, {i}de una forma u otra{/i}, no me importa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:133
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_7b316965:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "When you get back from whatever quest you’re on, it’s straight back to business as usual."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Cuando vuelvas de la misión en la que estés, todo volverá a la normalidad."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:134
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_e05fa4b2:

    # MARKUS "I take it refusal isn’t an option?"
    MARKUS "¿Supongo que la negativa no es una opción?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:135
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_7fdf85fe:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Sure, that’s an option!"
    LUKKAN @ talk "¡Claro, es una opción!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:136
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_0776bbc2:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "But if you don’t do as you’re told..."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Pero si no haces lo que te dicen..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:137
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_eb17a122:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "... You’ll find yourself back in the Scouts, serving the Emperor another way."
    LUKKAN @ talk "... Te encontrarás de vuelta en los exploradores, sirviendo al emperador de otra manera."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:138
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_78d22870:

    # MARKUS "Well, aren’t we spoiled for choice..."
    MARKUS "Bueno, no tenemos donde elegir..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:142
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_7ccc5fc4:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "You can find me in my office on the third floor of the Central Fort."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Puede encontrarme en mi despacho de la tercera planta del Fuerte central."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:143
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_4a376659:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "I manage all morale raising services and events around the kingdom, so just speak to me when you are able to attend and I will arrange a small rally."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Gestiono todos los servicios y actos para elevar la moral en todo el reino, así que habla conmigo cuando puedas asistir y organizaré una pequeña concentración."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:148
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_3a97b060:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "Good, now both of you get dressed and make sure you hand in your paperwork to the Guild later."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Bien, ahora vístanse los dos y asegúrense de entregar la documentación al gremio más tarde."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:149
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_5ae3af04:

    # MC @ talk "Are we free to go?"
    MC @ talk "¿Somos libres de irnos?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:150
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_8e7a523e:

    # LUKKAN @ talk "For now."
    LUKKAN @ talk "Por ahora."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:154
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_283e191a:

    # "The man said nothing else, just turned on his heel to leave and closed the doors behind him with a resounding finality."
    "El hombre no dijo nada más, se limitó a girar sobre sus talones para marcharse y cerró las puertas tras de sí con una rotunda firmeza."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:155
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_d1538343:

    # MARKUS "Well, you heard the man."
    MARKUS "Bueno, ya le has oído."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:156
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_fdbb2cd2:

    # MC @ talk "We should both head home first... let them see with their own eyes that we’re okay."
    MC @ talk "Deberíamos irnos los dos a casa primero... que vean con sus propios ojos que estamos bien."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:157
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_5fa2b150:

    # MC @ talk "Then we can head over to the Guild together."
    MC @ talk "Entonces podemos ir juntos al gremio."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:158
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_745b2720:

    # MARKUS "Agreed..."
    MARKUS "De acuerdo..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:159
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_f9f5891e:

    # MARKUS "Then let’s get that drink later... old friend."
    MARKUS "Entonces tomemos esa copa más tarde... viejo amigo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:160
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_6ef0204a:

    # MARKUS "By the way..."
    MARKUS "Por cierto..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:161
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_09acd630:

    # "Markus looked at me head to toe:"
    "Markus me miró de arriba a abajo:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:162
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_dcbfe622:

    # MARKUS "You should grab some... fitting clothes from the quartermaster."
    MARKUS "Deberías coger algo de... ropa adecuada del intendente."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:163
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_6e80ca82:

    # MC @ talk "That psycho? I'm not having anything to do with him."
    MC @ talk "¿Ese psicópata? No voy a tener nada que ver con él."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:164
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_5d9f6d55:

    # MARKUS "Come on, you want to strut around looking like this, you'll never make it home."
    MARKUS "Vamos, si quieres pavonearte con este aspecto, nunca llegarás a casa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:165
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_19b0b3e6:

    # MARKUS "Crowds of fan-girls will stomp you into the streets."
    MARKUS "Multitudes de admiradoras te pisotearán en las calles."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:166
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_2fb3a62d:

    # MC @ talk "*Sigh* Okay, I'll talk to Joakim."
    MC @ talk "*Suspiro* Está bien, hablaré con Joakim."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:167
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_fb968b98:

    # MC @ talk "I’ll see you later then."
    MC @ talk "Te veré más tarde entonces."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:169
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_fa49efb9:

    # "Markus nodded and left."
    "Markus asintió y se marchó."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:171
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_894a9fa0:

    # "I went to see Master Joakim as Markus had suggested."
    "Fui a ver a Joakim como me había sugerido Markus."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:172
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_72500c07:

    # "He was excited to see me alive {i}and{/i} in my new shape, commenting sarcastically on how the army 'brings out the best in men'..."
    "Estaba emocionado de verme vivo {i}y{/i} en mi nueva forma, comentando sarcásticamente cómo el ejército 'saca lo mejor de los hombres'..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:173
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_39ee51e5:

    # "After sizing me up, he cobbled together a set of somewhat worn clothes and light armor bits for me."
    "Después de evaluarme, me preparó un conjunto de ropas algo desgastadas y armaduras ligeras."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:178
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_ca26e42c:

    # "When I asked where these clothes come from, he just gave me {i}that grin{/i} of his..."
    "Cuando le pregunté de dónde venía esa ropa, me dedicó {i}esa sonrisan{/i} suya..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:179
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_a7ea10a1:

    # "Clean and well-fit as they were, I hoped the previous owners died a peaceful death."
    "Limpias y en buen estado como estaban, esperaba que los anteriores propietarios tuvieran una muerte pacífica."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:180
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_103e7ecb:

    # "As I was about to leave, Joakim pointed at a pile of rusty metal in the corner:"
    "Cuando estaba a punto de irme, Joakim señaló un montón de metal oxidado en la esquina:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:181
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_ae156156:

    # JOAKIM "Hey, you should grab one of these too."
    JOAKIM "Oye, deberías coger uno de estas también."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:182
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_8bf5f770:

    # JOAKIM "I don't want to see that fresh and strong body of yours wandering about unarmed."
    JOAKIM "No quiero ver ese sano y fuerte cuerpo tuyo vagando desarmado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:184
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_7b961e6b:

    # "He smiled and watched me examine one of the {i}better condition{/i} swords I picked up from the pile."
    "Sonrió y me miró mientras examinaba una de las espadas {i}en mejor estado{/i} que cogí del montón."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:189
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_65a0693a:

    # "Considering it a weapon would be a stretch."
    "Considerarlo un arma sería exagerado."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:190
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_da763072:

    # MC "...Okay, thanks I guess."
    MC "...Vale, gracias supongo."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:190
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_254a0b14:

    # JOAKIM "The Corp provides!"
    JOAKIM "¡La corporación provee!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:191
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_87f51fbf:

    # JOAKIM "Okay, off you go now! I've got some fresh recruits to work on."
    JOAKIM "Bien, ¡ahora vete! Tengo algunos reclutas nuevos en los que trabajar."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:197
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_506782ce:

    # MC "I guess it’s time to head home."
    MC "Supongo que es hora de volver a casa."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:202
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_74d9beee:

    # "Walking out of Fort Sebastian, I inhaled deeply and felt a tinge of relaxation:"
    "Al salir del fuerte Sebastian, inhalé profundamente y sentí una sensación de relajación:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:203
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_f6705bff:

    # MC "(Novaras City.)"
    MC "(Ciudad de Novaras)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:204
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_8efec8bd:

    # MC "(Home.)"
    MC "(En casa)."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:205
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_5cc7a1be:

    # MC "(At least it was before I got into this whole Scouts thing...)"
    MC "(Al menos lo era antes de meterme en todo esto de los exploradores...)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:187
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_04cfe897:

    # "Taking a few steps towards my house, I imagined talking to [regina_ref_cap!t] and hesitated a bit."
    "Dando unos pasos hacia mi casa, me imaginé hablando con [regina_ref_cap!t] y dudé un poco.."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:213
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_bcfa56f8:

    # MC "(Will she even recognize me?)"
    MC "(¿Siquiera me reconocerá?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Act1/FromAnotherWorld/qst_FAW_scr01.rpy:214
translate es qst_FromAnotherWorld_LukkanTalkMenu_3e42801b:

    # MC "(*Sigh* It feels like an eternity has passed since I left.)"
    MC "(*Suspiro* Parece que ha pasado una eternidad desde que me fui)."

